     to the prose measure so they read as a summary of the paragraph above
     rather than as a headline of their own. */
  .mcp-primitive-summary {
    display: grid;

    /* auto-fit against the longest label's intrinsic width, not a fixed three:
       RESOURCES is 9 tracked uppercase characters — 76px of ink plus the tile's
