       it. Three fixed columns put that label 19px outside its tile at 375px
       (true before the pin too, just 6px less of it); with a real floor the row
       drops to two tiles instead. */
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 6.5rem), 1fr));
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    max-width: var(--mcp-measure);
